.TH TCPDUMP 1 "December 2024" "Network Security" "Lab Commands"
.SH NAME
tcpdump_lab \- Customized tcpdump commands for Network Traffic Analysis Lab
.SH DESCRIPTION
Key tcpdump commands and BPF filters for capturing and analyzing
network packets (Lab Sheet 4: Part 1 & Part 2).
.SH BASIC COMMANDS
.TP
.B Capture on interface eth0 (real time)
sudo tcpdump -i eth0
.TP
.B Save capture to file
sudo tcpdump -i eth0 -w capture.pcap
.TP
.B Read packets from file
tcpdump -r capture.pcap
.TP
.B Detailed output (no name resolution)
sudo tcpdump -nn -vvv -i eth0
.SH LAB CHALLENGES (Filters)
.TP
.B Targeted capture (exercise 1)
sudo tcpdump -i eth0 -c 50 host TARGET_IP and host KALI_IP
.TP
.B Capture rotation (exercise 4)
sudo tcpdump -i eth0 -C 10 -W 5 -w /tmp/capture.pcap
.TP
.B Clear-text credentials (FTP/Telnet)
sudo tcpdump -i eth0 -w /tmp/creds.pcap tcp port 23 or tcp port 21
.SH AUTHOR
Exam preparation cheat-sheet.

